      "body": "## Motivation\n\nThe RDMA RoCE deployment guide uses `***` between its LeaderWorkerSet and Service resources. Copying the complete example into `lws.yaml` produces invalid YAML: the parser treats the asterisks as an invalid alias and rejects the manifest before deployment.\n\n## Modifications\n\nUse the YAML document separator `---` so the two resources are separate documents.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n- Reproduced the original `ScannerError` with PyYAML on the unchanged guide.\n- Parsed every YAML example in the corrected guide and verified both resources, the Service selector, and its target port.\n- All applicable pre-commit hooks passed.\n- Pre-commit was run for the changed documentation file; the repository-wide hook suite was not run.\n- `mint broken-links --check-anchors --check-redirects` passed.\n- `mint validate` reports two missing imports of `popular-models.jsx` from `index.mdx` and `cookbook/intro.mdx`; the unchanged upstream baseline fails with the same warnings.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable; this changes documentation syntax only.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the contribution guide.\n- [ ] Add unit tests. Not applicable; the complete documentation example was parsed directly.\n- [x] Update documentation.\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmarks. Not applicable.\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n",
